From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:14:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-sysreg: add
 google,zuma-peric1-sysreg

USI11 is at 0x10cb00c0 and its SW_CONF is at offset 0xc of the PERIC1
sysreg (0x10c21000), as in Google's devicetree. Add the zuma compatible to
the list of sysregs and to the condition that groups the PERIC sysregs of
the other Google SoCs.

Signed-off-by: Lef <me@lefteros.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml  | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
index 2a181df90..8cb6ce85d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ properties:
               - google,gs201-peric1-sysreg
               - google,gs201-vgpio2ap-sysreg
               - google,zuma-hsi0-sysreg
+              - google,zuma-peric1-sysreg
               - google,zuma-ufs-sysreg
               - google,zumapro-apm-sysreg
               - google,zumapro-hsi0-sysreg
@@ -116,6 +117,7 @@ allOf:
               - google,gs201-hsi2-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric0-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric1-sysreg
+              - google,zuma-peric1-sysreg
               - google,zumapro-apm-sysreg
               - google,zumapro-hsi0-sysreg
               - google,zumapro-peric0-sysreg
